        "heading": "How does FY2027 contracting in Oklahoma compare to prior years?",
        "body": "FY2027 obligations are $306M. FY26 obligations were $4.9B and FY25 obligations were $6.8B. Obligations fell 93.7% year over year, reflecting the partial-year nature of the FY2027 total."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Which agencies, vendors, and industries lead FY2027 obligations in Oklahoma?",
        "body": "The Department of Veterans Affairs leads buyers with $242M. SIGNATURE CHOICE III, LLC leads vendors with $226M, followed by AAR AIRCRAFT SERVICES, INC. at $12.4M. Direct Health and Medical Insurance Carriers leads industries with $226M, and Other Support Activities for Air Transportation has $13.5M."
      }
    ]
